/ Two queries — the second continues the first's conversation (it names the answer it continues), so the LLM
/ remembers what was said
Start
- [llm] system: 'You are a helpful assistant'
    user: 'My favorite color is blue. Remember that.'
    write to %first%
- [llm] user: 'What is my favorite color?'
    continue the conversation in %first%
    write to %second%
- assert %first% is not null
- assert %second% is not null
